### 장바구니 상품 추가
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "color": "BLACK"
}

### 장바구니 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartIds": [1, 2]
}

### 장바구니 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json